        "Ann",
        "Oceanid Ann",
        "little Oceanid"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Ann",
      "content": "Ann is a young Oceanid born accidentally from Mary-Ann's dream. She has the memories of both the human Mary-Ann and Lyris, and in the story played the hero seeking \"Princess Lyris\". When Mary-Ann sends her away from Annapausis, she wishes her to have her own soul, memories, personality and wishes. They later travel together.",
