      "key": [
        "Annapausis",
        "The Real Annapausis",
        "Chemin de L'Espoir"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Annapausis",
      "content": "Annapausis is the dream-world Mary-Ann built on the ruins of the Institute, shaped like a fairy tale. In the real Annapausis (4.0) she receives guests with tea, food that tastes like water, a sunflower garden and a \"dog\". She calls it \"our tomb\", and the Traveler deduces that their whole adventure was a story.",
