    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Rene",
        "Narzissenkreuz",
        "Rene de Petrichor"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Rene and Narzissenkreuz",
      "content": "Rene was a fellow Institute child who became the figure Narzissenkreuz and led the Ordo. In Rowboat's Wake Mary-Ann recognises him by name, forgives Rene but not yet Narzissenkreuz. He tells her that her state is beyond human or Oceanid, apologises for the circumstances that led there and declines to travel with her. She asks for his address so she can write.",
