    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Seymour",
        "robotic dog",
        "silly dog"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Seymour",
      "content": "Seymour is the dog-like machine Alain built for Mary-Ann. He survived the Elynas battle but over 30 percent of his components were damaged. He finds his mistress again in Rowboat's Wake. Mary-Ann tells him his old orders are void and asks what he wants; he chooses to stay with her and to accompany Mamere.",
