      "key": [
        "Holy Blade",
        "Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz",
      "content": "The Traveler uses the Holy Blade to break the \"Will to Resist\" around Mary-Ann's refuge. Rene suggested it could also separate the personas of Lyris and young Mary-Ann, but Mary-Ann refuses, saying Ann's adventure is hers alone and she will live as herself.",
