    "6": {
      "uid": 6,
      "key": [
        "Lyris",
        "Princess Lyris",
        "Red Empress"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mary-Ann: Lyris",
      "content": "Lyris was an Oceanid who directed the Narzissenkreuz Institute and later joined the Ordo as the Red Empress. She cared for the children and played games with them. At Elynas she dissolved the dying Mary-Ann and absorbed her consciousness. The \"Princess Lyris\" of Ann's story comes from a fairy tale the human told her.",
